    "chunk_text": "Fourth Paragraph:It is ordained that the period of service requisite to qualify for the Decoration shall be anaggregate of twenty five years Efficient Commissioned Service on the Active Strength of theSri Lanka Army Volunteer Force, and the ranks shall be Brigadier and above, subject to suchconditions as may be laid down in the regulations hereinafter mentioned, provided that theperiod of service so tendered previously to reward any other medal for Efficient Service in theSri Lanka Army Volunteer Force, may be reckoned to reward the Kariyakshama SevaVibhushanaya.\n\n2AI fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'11'21PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 21.11.2019\n\nEigth Paragraph:It is ordained that Officers who have the necessary qualifying service shall not be awarded theDecoration unless they are recommended by the Commandant of the Sri Lanka Army VolunteerForce in which the period of service requisite to qualify for the Decoration is completed ; and,finally approved by the Commander of the Sri Lanka Army, as efficient and thoroughly capableOfficers deserving in every way for the Decoration.\n\nNinth Paragraph:It is ordained that a recipient of this medal shall not be eligible for a second conferment orconferment of clasp during his lifetime.\n\nEleventh Paragraph:It is ordained that the reproductions of the Decoration in miniature, which may be worn oncertain occasions by those upon whom the Decoration is conferred, shall be half the size of theKariyakshama Seva Vibhushanaya.\n\nTwelfth Paragraph:It is ordained that sealed patterns of the Kariyakshama Seva Vibhushana, and its miniatures, areheld by the appropriate authority at the Sri Lanka Army Headquarters."
