    "chunk_text": "Ninthly Paragraph:It is ordained that sealed patterns of the Kariyakshama Seva Padakkama in miniature, which maybe worn on certain occasions by Commissioned Officers and Warrant Officers on whom theMedal is conferred, shall be half the size of the Kariyakshama Seva Padakkama.\n\nBY HIS EXCELLENCY MAITHRIPALA SIRISENA, PRESIDENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA\n\nSealMAITHRIPALA SIRISENA\n\nTenthly Paragraph:It is ordained that sealed patterns of the Kariyakshama Seva Padakkama and its miniatures areheld by the appropriate authority at the Sri Lanka Army Headquaters.\n\nEleventh Paragraph:It is ordained that it shall be competent for me or my elected successors, or, on a recommendationto that effect by, or, through, the Secretary Defence by an order under my seal and signature tocancel, and annul the award of the Medal, in respect of any person ; and that thereupon his nameis struck off the Register where such awards are recorded. But it shall be competent for me, orone for my elected successors to restore the Medal, when such recommendation has beenwithdrawn.\n\nTwelfth Paragraph:It is ordained that Medal shall be conferred under such regulations as to grant, forfeiture,restoration and other matters in amplification of this, my Proclamation as may with my approvalsignified through the Secretary Defence be issued from time to time by the Commander of theSri Lanka Army.\n\nThirteenth Paragraph:I reserve to myself and my elected Successors the full power of annulling, abrogating,augmenting, interpreting or dispensing with these rules and regulations, or any part thereof bya Notification under my Seal and Signature, or under my Command.\n\nBy His Excellency\u2019s Command,\n\nUDAYA R. SENEVIRATNE,Secretary to the President.\n\nOffice of Secretary to the President,Colombo,11th November, 2019.\n\n12 - 114/2\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
