    "chunk_text": "(Published by Authority)\n\n\u0001 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0007\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf \u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u000f \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u0013 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0016 \u0db4\u0018\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u0002 \u0004\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 EXTRAORDINARY The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nPART III - LANDS\n\nTitle Registration\n\nREGISTRATION OF TITLE ACT, No. 21 OF 1998\n\nDeclaration of Determination of the Commissioner of Title Settlement under Section 14\n\nBY virtue of the powers vested in me under Section 14 of the Registration of Title Act, No.21 of 1998, I, the undersigned, hereby de-clare my determination as set out in the Schedule appended hereto in regard to the title to parcel of Land Nos. 809, 1025, 1073, 1109 and 1136 of Block 01, contained in the Cadastral Map No. 110109, situated in the Village of Eliyadivulwewa, Katiyawa yaya 10, Katiy-awa Yaya 2, Katiyawa yaya 8, Katiyawa yaya 9 within the Grama Niladhari Division of No. 383 - Katayawa Yaya 06, 384 - Katayawa Yaya 09, 387 - Katayawa Yaya 02, 388 - Eliyadivulwewa, , in the Divisional Secretary's Division of Thalawa, in the District of Anuradhapura, in the Province of North Central, referred to in Notice No. 11/0096 calling for claims to land parcels which was duly published in the Gazette No. 1588/12 of 10th February, 2009 in terms of Section 12 of the Registration of Title Act, No.21 of 1998. P. M. H. PRIYADHARSHANI, Commissioner of Title Settlement Land Title Settlement Department, No. 1200/6, \u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d, Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla. 15th October, 2019.\n\nN.B.\u2013 This Extraordinary Gazette can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A - G 31544 - 14 (2019/11)\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2150/66 - 2019 \u0dd9\u0db1\u0013\u0dc0\u0dd0\u0016\u0db6\u0018 21 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u0019 \u001a\u0dc4\u0dc3\u0dca\u0db4\u0002 \u0daf\u0dcf - 2019.11.21 No. 2150/66 \u2013 THURSDAY, NOVEMBER 21, 2019\n\n2 A\n\nIII \u0dd9\u0d9