    "chunk_text": "wxl 2151$2 - 2019 fkdje\u00efn\u00be ui 25 jeks i`\u00ffod - 2019'11'25\n\nNo. 2151/2 \u2013 MONDAY, NOVEMBER 25, 2019\n\nThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nYS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nAS AMENDED BY THE LAND ACQUISITION\n\n(AMENDMENT) ACT, No. 28 OF 1964\n\nNotice under Section 7\n\nMy Reference No.: fldm%df,a$bw;a/3/20/NH.Land Ministry's Reference No: L/03/96/NH/382.\n\nI hereby give notice under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 ofthe Land Acquisition Act, No.28 of 1964(Amendment), thatthe Government intends to acquire the following land whichis required for a Public Purpose.\n\nDescription of the Land to be Acquired:\n\nTwo allotments of land in Total Extent of about 0.1166Hectare depicted as lots 1 to 2 in the Preliminary Plan No. Co.9823 dated 20.06.2019 situated in the Village calledPanchikawatta (Ward No. 25 within Colombo MunicipalCouncil limit) in the Divisional Secretary's Division ofColombo in Colombo District of the Western Province andmorefully described as follows:\n\n1. Lot No. 01Name of the Land: Assessment No. 175/40, 191/20 andother Sahir Cassim and Hajiyar Place; Description: Homegarden, Two permanent two storied buildings are available;\n\nOriginal Claimant: State;Claimant: W.T.Hemarathna, SittiSuleina and some others; Extent: 0.0905 Hec.\n\n2. Lot No. 02Name of the Land: Assessment number not available;Description: Road; Original Claimant: State;Claimant: couldnot be traced; Extent: 0.0261 Hec."
