    "chunk_text": "III fldgi \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2019'11'26PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 26.11.20191A\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%hThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nw;s \u00fafYI EXTRAORDINARY\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nwxl 2151$19 \u2013 2019 fkdje\u00efn\u00be 26 jeks w`.yrejdod \u2013 2019'11'26No. 2151/19 \u2013 TUESDAY, NOVEMBER 26, 2019\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nDeclaration under Section 5\n\nI, Gayantha Karunatilleke, Minister of Lands and ParliamentaryReforms, do hereby declare, under Sub-section (1) of Section 5 of theLand Acquisition Act, that the land described below are neededfor a public purpose and will be acquired under the provisions ofthat Act.\n\nThe Allotments of land depicted in the Advance Tracing No. GA/GFG/2019/391 of 08.07.2019 prepared by the Surveyor-General,situated in the Villages of Deddugoda South and Dangedara in theGrama Niladhari Divisions of Dangedara East, 97D and DeddugodaSouth, 101A in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Galle - FourGravets in the District of Galle in Southern Province and bounded asfollows:\n\n01. Lot \u2018A\u2019 \u2013 Mahamoragodawatta \u2013 Extent: About 0.0015HectareNorth: Mahamoragodawatta claimed by D. P. Y. Gamage; Eastand South: Road; West: Mahamoragodawatta claimed by D. P. Y.Gamage.\n\n02. Lot \u2018B\u2019 \u2013 Mahamoragodawatta \u2013 Extent: About 0.0014HectareNorth: Road; East: Mahamoragodawatta claimed by B. P. UdayaKasun; South and West: Road.\n\n03. Lot \u2018C\u2019 \u2013 Mahamoragodawatta \u2013 Extent: About 0.0013HectareNorth: Road and the land acquired for Moragoda canal; East:Wellabagala Eladdara Ovita claimed by H. M. Dharmasena; South:Road and Lot D; West: Road.\n\n04. Lot \u2018D\u2019 \u2013 Extent: About 0.0010 HectareNorth: Road and Lot C; East: Lot C, Wellabagala Eladdara Ovitaclaimed by H. M. Dharmasena and Road; South: Wellabagala EladdaraOvita claimed by unknown owner and Lot E; West: Road."
