G; West: Lots G, H and Amban Ganga.\n\n05. Lot \u2018E\u2019 - Medakindha - Extent: 0.4923 HectareNorth: Lots D, C and B; East: Lot B and Medakindha; South:Medakindha and Lot F; West: Lots F, G and D."
