    "chunk_text": "* The statute of the deity will be open to devotees for offerings and worshipping from 09.12.2019 atevening to 10.12.2019 early morning.\n\n* Early in the morning of 10.12.2019, the pageant will start from Sri Pada Raja Maha Vihara.\n\nII. on 2019.12.10 early morning the vehicle pageant will be conducted from Galpoththawela Sri Pada RajaMaha Vihara to Pelmadudlla Town, Ganegama, Pathakada, Sannasgama, Dippitigala, Lellopitiya,\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk1A - G 31594\u2014 27 (11/2019)\n\nI fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'11'28PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 28.11.20192A\n\nWelimaluwa, Pathulpana, Pelwadiya, Thiriwanaketiya, Batugedara, Warakathota, Kudugalwaththa, UrbanCouncil, clock tower, Dharmapala Mawatha, Moragahayata, Panadura Road, Galkaduwa, reache,Sabaragamuwa Maha Saman Devalaya and return to Moragahayata, Hospital Junction, Weralupe Junction,New Town Moragahayata, Hidellena Vidyalaya Mawatha, Farmgarden Junction, New Town, WeralupeJunction, Moragahayata, Pergasan Road, Bus stop, Kudugal Waththa thorugh Godigamuwa Malwala Road,to Sri Palabathgala Raja maha vihara, held the vehicle pageant with Kuruwita Eranda pageant conductedfrom Galpothawela Sri Pada Raja Maha Vihara to Pelmadulla, Ganegama, Pathakada, Sannasgama, Thipitigala,Lellopitiya, Welimalua, Pathupana, Pelwadiya, Thiruwanaketiya, Batugethara, Warakathota, Kudugal Waththa,Urban Council, Clock Tower, near the Dharmapala Mawaththa, Moragahayata, Galkaduwa, reach SamanDhewalaya done Buddha pooja, and return Kahangama Holipitiya, Gorakaela junction through pahathgamato Kuruwiya town Katuthiyambarawa through eknaligoda to reach Warnagala through Eratna Road, After thePalabathgala pageant, held the Pilgrimage."
