    "chunk_text": "Welimaluwa, Pathulpana, Pelwadiya, Thiriwanaketiya, Batugedara, Warakathota, Kudugalwaththa, UrbanCouncil, clock tower, Dharmapala Mawatha, Moragahayata, Panadura Road, Galkaduwa, reache,Sabaragamuwa Maha Saman Devalaya and return to Moragahayata, Hospital Junction, Weralupe Junction,New Town Moragahayata, Hidellena Vidyalaya Mawatha, Farmgarden Junction, New Town, WeralupeJunction, Moragahayata, Pergasan Road, Bus stop, Kudugal Waththa thorugh Godigamuwa Malwala Road,to Sri Palabathgala Raja maha vihara, held the vehicle pageant with Kuruwita Eranda pageant conductedfrom Galpothawela Sri Pada Raja Maha Vihara to Pelmadulla, Ganegama, Pathakada, Sannasgama, Thipitigala,Lellopitiya, Welimalua, Pathupana, Pelwadiya, Thiruwanaketiya, Batugethara, Warakathota, Kudugal Waththa,Urban Council, Clock Tower, near the Dharmapala Mawaththa, Moragahayata, Galkaduwa, reach SamanDhewalaya done Buddha pooja, and return Kahangama Holipitiya, Gorakaela junction through pahathgamato Kuruwiya town Katuthiyambarawa through eknaligoda to reach Warnagala through Eratna Road, After thePalabathgala pageant, held the Pilgrimage.\n\nThereafter through Royal road and Hatton road the statute of the deity and the enclosure casket with relicswill be carried in \u201cDolawa\u201d upto the top of the Samantha Kuta Summit and the pageant and the ceremonywill be ended.*\n\n* The priority should be given to vehicles nominated by the Chief Incumbent Thero and the other vehiclesshould follow -suit after those vehicles without obstructing the line-up.\n\n2. Here by declare that trading in the temple premises is prohibited. The conducting of trading activities and dansalcould be done along the main road and the by-roads upto the Sri Pada Vihara but without any obstruction to thedevotees and the Pageant.\n\n3. Hereby declare that collection of aids and contributions are prohibited from Pelmadulla Town up to Sri PadaTemple premises."
