    "chunk_text": "G31595 \u2013 11 (11/2019)\n\n2AI fldgi: (I) fPoh \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2019'11'28PART I: SEC. (I) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 28.11.2019\n\nMy No.: IR/COM/03/2019/78.\n\nTHE INDUSTRIAL DISPUTES ACT, CHAPTER 131 OF THE LEGISLATIVE ENACTMENTS OF CEYLON( 1956 REVISED EDITION)\n\nMrs. S. Priyani Malkanthi Martheenu, No. 121/11, Prison Residencies, Lesly Ranagala Mawatha, Colombo 08. of the one part,\n\nand\n\nLand Reform Commission, No. 475, Kaduwela Road, Battaramulla. of the other part,\n\nSTATEMENT OF MATTER IN DISPUTE\n\nThe matter in dispute between the aforesaid parties is .\u2013\n\n\u2018\u2018Whether Mrs. S. Priyani Malkanthi Martheenu, who was appointed as a Grade VI Clerk of the Court, Land Reform Commission from03.08.1998 has been caused injustice by working without promotions up to date and if so, to what reliefs she is entitled.\u2019\u2019\n\nA. WIMALAWEERA,Commissioner General of Labour.\n\nDated at the Office of the Commissioner General of Labour,Colombo this 13th day of November, 2019.\n\n12 - 462"
