    "chunk_text": "IV ^wd& jeks fldgi \u2013 YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'10'03Part IV (B) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 03.10.20191A\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2151$53 - 2019 fkdje\u00efn\u00be ui 29 jeks isl=rdod - 2019'11'29No. 2151/53 - FRIDAY NOVEMBER 29, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nFILLING OF A VACANCY IN THE OFFICE OF MEMBER OF THE NEGOMBO MUNICIPALCOUNCIL UNDER SECTION 66A(1) OF THE LOCAL AUTHORITIES ELECTIONS ORDINANCE(CHAPTER 262)\n\nWHEREAS the office of return member of Negombo Municipal Council has fallen vacant by reason ofResignation ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Leader of the Independent Group 03, the Independent Group to which Rodriguge SunilWilfred Silva the member belonged, was required by me under Section 66A(1) of the aforesaid ordinance, to decide uponreturned member of Independent Group 03 who belongs to such Independent Group and is not disqualified under section9 of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance and who shall be declared selected as a member within a period of thirty(30) days ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Leader of the aforesaid Independent Group has communicated his decision to nominateWarnakulasuriya Shamal Harshana Fernando to fill such vacancy ;\n\nNOW THEREFORE, I, Karunasingha Jayarathnage Sampath Madhawa, Returning Officer of the NegomboMunicipal Council, acting in terms of Section 66A(1) of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance (Chapter 262) dohereby declare that Warnakulasuriya Shamal Harshana Fernando was selected as the member of the Negombo MunicipalCouncil.\n\nK. J. S. MADHAWA,Returning Officer,Negombo Municipal Council.District Election Office,Gampaha,29th of November, 2019.\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART IV (B) \u2014 LOCAL GOVERNMENT\n\nNotices under the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance"
