    "chunk_text": "IV ^wd& jeks fldgi \u2013 YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'06'03Part IV (B) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 03.06.20191A\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2151$57 - 2019 fkdje\u00efn\u00be ui 29 jeks isl=rdod - 2019'11'29No. 2151/57 - FRIDAY NOVEMBER 29, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nFILLING OF A VACANCY IN THE OFFICE OF MEMBER OF THE POLONNARUWAPRADESHIYA SABHA UNDER SECTION 66A(1) OF THE LOCAL AUTHORITIES ELECTIONSORDINANCE (CHAPTER 262)\n\nWHEREAS the office of return member of Polonnaruwa Pradeshiya Sabha has fallen vacant by reason of Resignation ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the People\u2019s Liberation Front, the recognized political party to whichD. Lahiru Ashen the member belonged, was required by me under Section 66 A (1) of the aforesaid ordinance, to decideupon returned member of People\u2019s Liberation Front who belongs to such party and is not disqualified under Section 9 ofthe Local Authorities Elections Ordinance and who shall be declared selected as a member within a period of thirty (30)days ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the aforesaid recognized Political Party has communicated his decision tonominate H. M. Sunil Kulathilaka to fill such vacancy ;\n\nNOW THEREFORE, I, Leelanath Wickrama Arachchi, Returning Officer of the Polonnaruwa Pradeshiya Sabha,acting in terms of Section 66A(1) of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance (Chapter 262) do hereby declare thatH. M. Sunil Kulathilaka was selected as the member of the Polonnaruwa Pradeshiya Sabha.\n\nLEELANATH WICKRAMA ARACHCHI,Returning Officer,Polonnaruwa Pradeshiya Sabha.District Election Office,Polonnaruwa,27th of November, 2019.\n\n12 - 510\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART IV (B) \u2014 LOCAL GOVERNMENT\n\nNotices under the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance"
