    "chunk_text": "1AIV (w) jeks fldgi \u2014 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'12'03PART IV(A) \u2014 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 03.12.2019\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2152$14 - 2019 foie\u00efn\u00be ui 03 jeks w\u00d5yrejdod - 2019'12'03No. 2152/14 - TUESDAY DECEMBER 03, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART IV (A) \u2014 PROVINCIAL COUNCILS\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nProvincial Councils Notifications\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk1A - PG 4781\u2014 37 (12/2019)\n\nWESTERN PROVINCE PROVINCIAL COUNCIL\n\nInquiry conducted under Section 184(1a) of the Urban Councils Ordinance read with Section 2 of theProvincial Councils (Consequential Provisions) Act, No. 12 of 1989\n\nI, Wijayapala Sri Narayana Wasala Bandaranayake Mohottalalage Seetha Kumari Arambepola, the Governor of WesternProvince do hereby appoint the retired Court of Appeal Judge Mr. Chandradasa Nanayakkara according to the powersvested in me as per provisions of Section 184(1a) of the Urban Councils Ordinance read with Section two of the ProvincialCouncils (Consequential Provisions) Act, No. 12 of 1989 to inquire into the following matters/allegations and revealwhether the offences stipulated under Subsection 184(1) of the above said ordinance have been committed by Wattala-Mabola Urban Council and by Chairman of Wattala-Mabola Urban Council while functioning in his office, and submit mea report within a period of 03 months.\n\nMatters/allegations to be inquired in relation to Wattala-Mabola Urban Council :-"
