    "chunk_text": "I, Wijayapala Sri Narayana Wasala Bandaranayake Mohottalalage Seetha Kumari Arambepola, the Governor of WesternProvince do hereby appoint the retired Court of Appeal Judge Mr. Chandradasa Nanayakkara according to the powersvested in me as per provisions of Section 184(1a) of the Urban Councils Ordinance read with Section two of the ProvincialCouncils (Consequential Provisions) Act, No. 12 of 1989 to inquire into the following matters/allegations and revealwhether the offences stipulated under Subsection 184(1) of the above said ordinance have been committed by Wattala-Mabola Urban Council and by Chairman of Wattala-Mabola Urban Council while functioning in his office, and submit mea report within a period of 03 months.\n\nMatters/allegations to be inquired in relation to Wattala-Mabola Urban Council :-\n\nII. Wattala-Mabola Urban Council in its functioning on 05.03.2019 or on a date adjacent to it, committing anoffence chargeable under Section 184(1)(d) of Urban Councils Ordinance by causing to sell, under anundervalued consideration and external to the prescribed tender procedure, the land in possession of Wattala-Mabola Urban Council containing 79 Perches in extent or an extent equal to that marked as Lot No. 1A2 inthe Plan No. 1377C dated 17th January 2018 made by Licensed Surveyor D. A. Weerakkody, and therebycausing a loss to the Urban Councils Fund.\n\nIV (w) jeks fldgi \u2014 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'12'03PART IV(A) \u2014 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 03.12.20192A"
