    "chunk_text": "I. While functioning as the Chairman of Wattala-Mabola Urban Council, committing an offence chargeableunder Section 184(1)(e) of the Urban Councils Ordinance during the period of 21.05.2018 to 13.07.2018or during a period adjacent to it by taking action to obtain an undervalued consideration to the land inpossession of Wattala-Mabola Urban Council containing 79 Perches in extent or an extent equivalent tothat marked as Lot No. 1A2 of the Plan No. 1377C dated 17th January 2018 made by Licensed SurveyorD. A. Weerakkody, stating that the said land will be sold on deed of transfer to Melco Oxygen Company Ltd.\n\nIII. While functioning as the Chairman of Wattala-Mabola Urban Council, committing an offence chargeableunder Section 184(1)(b) of Urban Councils Ordinance on 01.03.2019 or on a date adjacent to it by takingaction to issue the letter of acceptance expressing consent to sell the land in possession of Wattala-Mabola Urban Council containing an extent of 79 Perches or of an extent equivalent to such marked as LotNo. 1A2 of the Plan No. 1377C dated 17th January 2018 made by Licensed Surveyor D. A. Weerakkody, toMohamed Subeir Fauzal Haq residing at No. 28, Bagathale Road, Colombo 03 without a resolution passedby Wattala-Mabola Urban Council.\n\nIV. While functioning as the Chairman of Wattala-Mabola Urban Council, committing an offence chargeableunder Section 184(1)(c) of the Urban Councils Ordinance during the period of 17.02.2019 to 01.03.2019or during a period adjacent to it by taking action without considering the instructions and/or directivesdated 07.02.2019 of the Minister in Charge of the subject of Local Government of Western Provincerelating to the sale of land in possession of Wattala-Mabola Urban Council containing 79 Perches inextent or an extent equivalent to that marked as Lot No. 1A2 of the Plan No. 1377C dated 17th January2018 made by Licensed Surveyor D. A. Weerakkody."
