    "chunk_text": "(Published by Authority)\n\n\u0001 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0007\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf \u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u000f \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u0013 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0016 \u0db4\u0018\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u0002 \u0004\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 EXTRAORDINARY The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nPART III - LANDS\n\nTitle Registration\n\nREGISTRATION OF TITLE ACT, No. 21 OF 1998\n\nDeclaration of Determination of the Commissioner of Title Settlement under Section 14\n\nBY virtue of the powers vested in me under Section 14 of the Registration of Title Act, No.21 of 1998, I, the undersigned, hereby de-clare my determination as set out in the Schedule appended hereto in regard to the title to parcel of Land Nos. 9 and 118 of Block 01, contained in the Cadastral Map No. 510207, situated in the Village of Borugamuwa within the Grama Niladhari Division of No. 336 - Borukgamuwa in the Divisional Secretary's Division of Meerigama, in the District of Gampaha, in the Province of Western, referred to in Notice No. 51/0091 calling for claims to land parcels which was duly published in the Gazette No. 1583/17 of 08th January, 2009 in terms of Section 12 of the Registration of Title Act, No.21 of 1998. P. M. H. PRIYADHARSHANI, Commissioner of Title Settlement (Covering up Duties.) Land Title Settlement Department, No. 1200/6, \u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d, Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla. 23rd September, 2019.\n\nN.B.\u2013 This Extraordinary Gazette can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A - G 31609 - 14 (2019/12)\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2152/17 - 2019 \u0dd9\u0daf\u0dc3\u0dd0\u0015\u0db6\u0017 03 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u001a \u0d85\u0d9f\u0dc4 \u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf - 2019.12.03\n\nNo. 2152/17 \u2013 TUESDAY, DECEMBER 03, 2019\n\n2 A\n\nIII \u0dd9\u0d9a\u001a\u0da7\u0dc3 - \u0001 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0007\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf \u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u000f \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u00