h day of October, 2019.\n\nBy-Law on Mobile Trading in Balangoda Urban Council Authoritative Area\n\n1. This by-law is enacted to regulate, administrate, inspect on the business of food and other goods by mobile trading within the authoritative area of Balangoda Urban Council.\n\n2. This by-law is known as the by-law of mobile trading of Balangoda Urban Council.\n\n3.(1) No person shall sell food or any other goods in the area of authority of the Balangoda Urban Council unless there"
